  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A small square pastel painting of rounded hills and blob creatures by a blue river, with a flying pod and rows of tiny figures.",
    "description": "A square oil painting on wood, photographed at very low resolution. Rounded pastel hills in orange, pink, green and lilac rise at the top, with a few eye like patches. A blue river curves across the middle, and a flying pod with a pointed nose hovers at upper right. The lower half is a plain of lime and salmon with rows of tiny figures and larger blob creatures in orange, blue and green with small limbs. Thin dark outlines and matte colour.",
    "impression": "A cousin of the other Desertland scenes with the crowd thinned to a few blobs by a river. The flying pod gives it a sense of visitors arriving. Hard to say more from the small photograph.",
